# Forward KL — §6.2. Fin-SD with the divergence direction flipped: minimises
# forward KL(teacher ‖ student), mass-covering, over the same student-rollout
# positions. Reverse KL is Fin-SD's default (mode-seeking).
#
#   python launch.py --config configs/forward-kl.env
EXTENDS=finsd.env

STUDENT_ROLLOUT_FORWARD=1
